mune process: considered but ranked lower due to lack of specific markers (e.g., antinuclear antibodies, inflammatory labs not mentioned)", "Chronic infection (e.g., TB): considered but ranked lower due to absence of localized signs (e.g., lung findings) and presence of blasts"], "alarm_features": ["Constitutional symptoms (fever, night sweats, weight loss)", "Hematologic abnormalities (blasts, anemia, thrombocytopenia)"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Myeloid Neoplasm with Increased Blasts", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.0, "posterior": 0.5592342695747686, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.5, "evidence_for": ["Thrombocytopenia and anemia with blasts suggest acute transformation rather than chronic phase."], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": ["B1.1", "B1.2", "B1.3"], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 1.0, "interrupt_relevance": 0.9, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": ["acute myeloid leukemia", "myelodysplastic syndrome with excess blasts", "chronic myeloid leukemia in blast crisis"]}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Lymphoid Neoplasm with Increased Blasts", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.055, "danger": 0.8, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": ["Absence of lymphoid markers strongly argues against lymphoid neoplasm."]}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Chronic Myeloproliferative Neoplasm (chronic/accelerated phase)", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.3498233215547703, "posterior": 0.24854856425545271, "danger": 0.7, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": ["Subacute symptoms suggest a chronic process (e.g., CML in blast crisis) over de novo AML."], "evidence_against": ["Thrombocytopenia and anemia with blasts suggest acute transformation rather than chronic phase."], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.8, "interrupt_relevance": 0.7, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": ["chronic myeloid leukemia", "polycythemia vera", "essential thrombocythemia", "primary myelofibrosis"]}, "B4": {"id": "B4", "label": "Lymphoproliferative / Plasma Cell Disorder", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.118, "danger": 0.6, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": ["Lack of plasma cell-specific findings (Bence Jones, lytic lesions) weakens the case for multiple myeloma."]}, "B5": {"id": "B5", "label": "Reactive / Non-malignant Leukocytosis", "level": 1, "status": "closed_for_now", "posterior": 0.02, "danger": 0.5, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": ["35% blasts are highly specific for malignancy, making reactive leukocytosis unlikely."]}, "B1.1": {"id": "B1.1", "label": "De Novo Acute Myeloid Leukemia", "parent": "B1", "level": 2, "status": "live", "prior": 0.2796171347873843, "posterior": 0.2796171347873843, "danger": 0.85, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.5, "interrupt_relevance": 0.8, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "etiology", "representative_diseases": []}, "B1.2": {"id": "B1.2", "label": "CML Blast Crisis", "parent": "B1", "level": 2, "status": "live", "prior": 0.13980856739369216, "posterior": 0.13980856739369216, "danger": 0.9, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.7, "interrupt_relevance": 0.9, "level_role": "fam